&lt;h2&gt;We are looking for a seasoned professional to join our Brand Business team. This is a high-impact role designed for a digital media expert who understands the nuances of the agency ecosystem and has a passion for driving incremental revenue through innovative ad-tech solutions. Work with a comprehensive suite of tools spanning mobile, display, and video. Lead market development by building deep-rooted relationships with major global media agencies.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robust experience of 3-5 years in digital media sales having exposure with digital publisher or network dealing in display/ mobile/ video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seasoned and experienced executive in Digital and Advertising agency with in-depth knowledge and profound expertise in the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of industry trends, technologies, and pricing models for display/ mobile/ video platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on market development and creating incremental revenue sources from new clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven communication, presentation, and sales skills with a knack for consultative selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent relationships and networking with media fraternity such as advertisers and agency planners/ buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to strike effective conversations, find need gaps, and get briefs for campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing sales strategies &amp;amp; action plans to win new agencies to achieve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating requirements; developing and convincing clients with support from internal/function teams; integrating contract requirements with business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new areas of growth and upsell opportunities between client&#39;s needs and POKKT products Offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
