&lt;li&gt;Should have a strong understanding of the competitive landscape in terms of Networks, Publishers and ad-tech platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Should be well versed with all aspects of the Programmatic ecosystem in terms of DSPs, SSPs, Trading Desks, PMPs, PG etc. Should have a strong understanding of trading within Media agencies and be able to close preferred partner/Trading&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; deals in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Should be very familiar with all key Digital Media metrics and KPIs such as CPM, CPCV, Completion rates, Brand Safety, In-target, Engagement-rates etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Should have basic understanding of Data, audience profiles, third party tools and other relevant technologies in Digital Brand Advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
