&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are proud to share that BAYADA at Inspira has been named a 2026 Best Home Health Agency by U.S. News &amp;amp; World Report. This recognition reflects our team’s continued commitment to providing compassionate, reliable, and excellent care to our clients and communities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
