&lt;li&gt;Must have reliable transportation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to communicate in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be authorized to work in the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No license? We offer Home Health Aide Certification courses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities for HHA – Home Health Aides:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
