&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ebury helps ambitious businesses unlock global growth, and we take the same approach with our people. We encourage innovation and movement, collaboration and problem-solving, and foster an environment where everyone can feel they belong, are valued, supported and empowered to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re a collaborator who wants to help transform how businesses operate globally, get in touch - we’d love to discuss how Ebury can accelerate your career so you can shape the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Engineer - AI Platform Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;: 4 days in the office, 1 day working from home&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Our Data Team at &lt;strong&gt;Ebury&lt;/strong&gt; Madrid or Malaga Office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ebury&#39;s strategic growth plan would not be possible without our Data team and we are seeking an &lt;strong&gt;Data Engineer -&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;AI Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our &lt;strong&gt;Data Platform Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to develop, maintain and improve Ebury&#39;s Data Platform — and we are now extending that mission to build the &lt;strong&gt;Agentic Data Plane (ADP)&lt;/strong&gt;: a unified, governed interfacing layer for AI and agentic products that abstracts communication and access to data whilst enforcing governance, lineage, traceability, and full replayability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AI Platform Engineer, you will work closely with the rest of the Data Platform team and cross-functional domain teams to design and deliver the platform capabilities that let Ebury ship AI and agentic products safely and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus based on performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued personal development through training and certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are Open Source friendly, following Open Source principles in our internal projects and encouraging contributions to external projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver core components of Ebury&#39;s Agentic Data Plane, including agent-to-agent (A2A) communication, the Agent Tool Registry, and governed data access layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build platform primitives for secure tool use coordination, including &quot;on behalf of&quot; (OBO) patterns, centralized policy guardrails, and audit logging with full replayability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide end-to-end observability for agentic products: data dependencies, traces, evaluation signals, and accountability as a day-one requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate the ADP with the Data Platform&#39;s governed foundations — catalog, metadata, data warehouse, and vector retrieval&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with domain teams to onboard pilot agents and help them adopt platform standards and runtime patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation and explore emerging technologies (LLM evaluation, prompt safety, agent memory) to enhance our AI platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivation and curiosity, with a desire to learn and grow in a fast-paced environment, continuously improving both technical and business skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform engineering experience building internal platforms consumed by other engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals: API design, reliability, testing, and operability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building secure systems — authentication/authorization, audit logs, least-privilege access, and governance controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience operating production services on &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt;, including services such as Vertex AI, BigQuery, Cloud Run, and Cloud Functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for building platform services, data transformation, and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;agentic or LLM-based systems in production&lt;/strong&gt; (evaluation, drift monitoring, prompt safety) is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data governance concepts — lineage, traceability, access controls — and data platform ecosystems is encouraged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (Spanish, a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited about this job opportunity but your background doesn&#39;t match exactly the requirements in the job description, we strongly encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other positions we have.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
